# Normalize text files to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
# Without this, core.autocrlf rewrites checked-out files to CRLF and every
# edit shows a "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warning.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep binary assets untouched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.tgz binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
